## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-09-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor Tempo (Roam)

- Items: Lantern of Hope, Demon Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Glowing Wand, Oracle
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Glowing Wand when Use when enemy sustain is tied to divers and basic attackers who will repeatedly damage Floryn or her front line.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against Eudora, Kagura, or other magic burst that can remove Floryn before Bloom matters.; Winter Crown over Oracle when Use when a single dive combo is predictable and stasis buys more survival value than Oracle's shield and regen boost.; Immortality over Oracle when Use when games run long enough that a guaranteed second life matters more than Oracle's shield and regen boost.
- Total cost: 8530 gold

Default ranked roam setup built around Favor, Flask, Bloom resets, ranged anti-heal pressure, and Oracle's defensive boost to survive dives. The Lantern of Hope holds the first slot all game and can never be sold, so Floryn buys five items.

### Roam Anti-Sustain Defense (Roam)

- Items: Lantern of Hope, Tough Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Fleeting Time
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when repeated physical contact is the main threat and the enemy has limited crowd control.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against sustained magic poke or burn that chips Floryn before objective fights.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill burst from fighters or assassins is killing Floryn during rotation windows.; Glowing Wand over Dominance Ice when Use when Floryn can stay outside dive range and needs ranged Lifebane application instead of contact-based anti-heal.
- Total cost: 8470 gold

Defensive roam setup for sustain brawls where Floryn must live close enough to keep Favor, Oracle, and anti-heal value online. The Lantern of Hope holds the first slot all game and can never be sold, so Floryn buys five items.

### Roam Revitalize Heal Scaling (Roam)

- Items: Lantern of Hope, Demon Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Blood Wings
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Revitalize
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Glowing Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when enemy sustain or shields matter more than maximum heal scaling.; Athena's Shield over Holy Crystal when Use when magic burst reaches Floryn before she can safely convert the extra magic power into healing.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use against delayed dive patterns where stasis buys time for Bloom and Sow to land, even at the cost of Holy Crystal's magic power.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use when the enemy bursts through Blood Wings' shield in one combo, and a second life matters more than its magic power and movement speed.
- Total cost: 9720 gold

Greedier save setup for grouped objective fights where Revitalize and magic power scaling matter more than personal escape tools. The Lantern of Hope holds the first slot all game and can never be sold, so Floryn buys five items.

